MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Noah,

Garnett is not designed to train on bulk RNA-seq data, but you should be able to train on the same data you're trying to classify!

Best,
Hannah

